<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS7" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Opponent Shaping in LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.7 </span>Shaper evaluation for varying game lengths for the IPD, IMP, and ICG</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS8" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Opponent Shaping in LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.8 </span>Training Dynamics</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS9" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Opponent Shaping in LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.9 </span>Training Prompts</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
