<div id="A1.SS3.SSS2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ A.3.2 Shaper Hyperparameters ‣ A.3 Training Implementation details for reproducibility ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Opponent Shaping in LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> shows the learning rate, value function coefficient, and clipping range used to train the shapers across all experiments in the main text. The remaining hyperparameters used during training for all experiments are shown in Table <a href="#A1.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ A.3.2 Shaper Hyperparameters ‣ A.3 Training Implementation details for reproducibility ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Opponent Shaping in LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.3.3 </span>Package Versions</h4>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We used the following versions for the main Python packages:</p>
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">BitsAndBytes</span>: v0.45.0</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">PEFT</span>: v0.14.0</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">torch</span>: v2.5.1</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
