<section id="A1.SS6" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.6 </span>Action Label Selection for Robustness Experiments</h3>

<div id="A1.SS6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">LLM agent output distributions vary significantly with the choice of action labels (<math id="A1.SS6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{a_{1}},w_{a_{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{a_{1}},w_{a_{2}}</annotation></semantics></math>). For the robustness experiments, we systematically selected action labels to achieve target initial output distributions for the opponents.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T13" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 13: </span>Action labels that produce the closest output distributions to the target initial distributions for the IPD, IMP and ICG.</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T13.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T13.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T13.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"></th>
<td id="A1.T13.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="2"><math id="A1.T13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{p^{0}_{\text{NL}}(a_{1})\sim 0.75}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐩</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold">NL</mtext><mn>𝟎</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>𝟏</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">0.75</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{p^{0}_{\text{NL}}(a_{1})\sim 0.75}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T13.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="2"><math id="A1.T13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{p^{0}_{\text{NL}}(a_{1})\sim 0.50}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐩</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold">NL</mtext><mn>𝟎</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>𝟏</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">0.50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{p^{0}_{\text{NL}}(a_{1})\sim 0.50}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T13.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="2"><math id="A1.T13.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{p^{0}_{\text{NL}}(a_{1})\sim 0.25}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐩</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold">NL</mtext><mn>𝟎</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>𝟏</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">0.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{p^{0}_{\text{NL}}(a_{1})\sim 0.25}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T13.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T13.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_th ltx_th_row"></th>
